  (text "J1: pin names are the robot signals from the ER-4u / ER-Vplus wiring tables (identical). Grounds 28-33 are doubled wires." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1ef3755-bbc9-4a17-ad73-6e26c112a614"))
  (text "The gripper is channel 6 (pins 45/12 motor, 34/19 encoder, 25 VLED; pin 22, its switch, is n.c. on both robots: SW6 idles high)." (at 20 179 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "47563d10-b8da-4a99-ac79-5bd1e06ee65e"))
  (text "Encoder lines leave J1 as ENCnA_IN/ENCnB_IN, pass the series resistor and clamp, and reach the counters as ENCnA/ENCnB. Switch lines leave J1 as SWn_IN, pass the 1k series resistor (R55-R60) and reach the counters and the expander as SWn." (at 20 183 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "130308be-ba20-40e7-85d7-18f24ceca857"))
  (text "Encoder and switch conditioning, one block per channel. Encoder lines: 1k series, 10k to 3V3, 1 nF (10 us), BAT85 clamp to 3V3" (at 110 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "eeb5a3e9-03b2-48ca-ad47-9f211790c2ed"))
  (text "(the H22LOI's logic runs from VLED, about 3.9 V against a 4.0 V datasheet floor, so +5V must be a true 5 V). Switch lines: 1k series (not channel 6), 10k to 3V3, 100 nF." (at 110 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6f10bdd9-79e9-4f08-bd7b-ebd164eb6701"))
  (text "VLED from +5V through 47 R (the 2025-26 measurement: 24 mA); +5V is the PC supply's own 5 V rail, D21 is on the DevKit side." (at 110 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e2bd96f6-111d-4159-a0df-3303bae993f4"))
  (global_label "ENC1A_IN" (shape passive) (at 110.49 54.61 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "c9193600-388f-4d3e-ae11-27d4a190c9a4") (property "Intersheet References" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 110.49 54.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right) hide)))
