  (text "U1: ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 (not ...V). TX/RX (43/44) = the USB-UART bridge, the first micro-USB: the Pi link (ACL text at 9600, or protobuf) and flashing." (at 470 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "809d757d-5562-568a-99f6-a233c056a52f"))
  (text "19/20 = the native USB, the second micro-USB: console, logs, JTAG. Strapping pins 0, 3, 45, 46 open; 35, 36, 37 open (PSRAM). 38/48 = the encoder 5 V sense. The ROM's boot line on" (at 470 64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "3d254651-3300-5981-a76b-3f490632f227"))
  (text "UART0 is silenced by the UART_PRINT_CONTROL eFuse (commissioning). SPI2 on 11/12/13 to the seven counters, chip selects 10 down to 4, their" (at 470 68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6fe90753-31b6-4657-b234-ec60e7efc60a"))
  (text "4 MHz filter clock on 14. PWM 15-18 and 39-41 (LEDC), SLP on 42 (R45 holds it low through reset), I2C on 1/2, expander INT on 47, pixels on 21." (at 470 72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "faaf669d-b4af-468b-8d20-594d9da99534"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Scorbot:R") (at 500.38 175.26 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "73ec67a8-c3ff-4efb-a0fb-18221b648bd4")
