  (text "C22-C28: 100 nF at each counter's VDD" (at 672 310 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6cea004d-9576-4b5b-a9f4-ed861e33b07c"))
  (text "Motor drivers: one Pololu G2 18v17 socket per channel; the gripper's (U7) and the rail's (U8) modules fitted when those axes are wired." (at 700 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "83b12b21-f33e-470c-9768-77d8479eb4f9"))
  (text "PWM 20 kHz from the S3; DIR through the DIR expander, FLT through the sense expander, SLP from IO42; CS (20 mV/A, drive time only) to the" (at 700 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9c6c5ea8-c2d5-4e81-a174-2868a9fc765f"))
  (text "ADCs. Logic pins take 1.8 to 5.5 V, no supply needed: the 3V3 pin is the module's own regulator output and stays open." (at 700 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9db69d28-ae10-4ca8-8348-d44dfe4941ad"))
