  (text "MCP23017 x2 (design doc 8.3). U9 at 0x20, the DIR chip: GPA0-6 DIR1-7 (out), GPA7 driven low; GPB0 ESTOP_SENSE (in), GPB1-6 spare, GPB7 low." (at 470 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "cd8f7ef7-ab98-47e3-b0d6-0c4a693eaf99"))
  (text "U10 at 0x21, the sense chip: GPA0-6 FLT1-7 (in, internal pull-ups), GPB0-6 SW1-7 (in), GPA7/GPB7 low. GPA7/GPB7 are never inputs (datasheet rev D)." (at 470 234 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d6f5d00e-a733-4f97-89ca-1b841079c309"))
  (text "Both INTA on one open-drain INT line (R54 pull-up) to IO47. ADS1015 0x48: CS1-4 at +/-256 mV (20 mV/A). 0x49: CS5-7, A3 = VSENSE (rail / 4.9 at +/-4.096 V)." (at 470 238 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "8c791085-bece-406b-88cd-735395c14536"))
