  (text "MOTORS ON chain: +12V_IN -> F2 1 A -> +12V_CHAIN -> SW1 e-stop (NC) -> J4 external e-stop (NC; a wire link in J4 when none) -> ESTOP_LOOP -> SW2 MOTORS ON -> K2_COIL -> K2 coil; K2 contact ESTOP_LOOP -> COIL -> K1 coil, and COIL -> D25 -> K2 coil (hold)." (at 130 512 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e1e50690-315f-4baa-ab09-81a1ab604210"))
  (text "SW2 switches only K2's coil; K2's contact then feeds K1 and holds K2 through D25, so a released e-stop or a power cycle leaves the motors off until MOTORS ON. ESTOP_SENSE = loop / 4 (3.0 V; the MCP23017 needs 0.8 VDD = 2.64 V) to U9 GPB0." (at 130 516 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "82105fe8-32fe-4765-a3fb-e96970aa7937"))
