  (text "Pi link: the Pi talks to the controller over the DevKit's USB-UART bridge (UART0), the same serial text the Eshed box speaks" (at 24 432 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "212efb0a-ad4a-4899-a5f9-2fd37d7a163f"))
  (text "(ACL, 9600 8N1), through a panel-mount USB extension in the enclosure. The Pi is not powered from this board and nothing of it" (at 24 436 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "299b2fff-709b-472d-a78a-804593836a98"))
  (text "plugs in but that cable. The DevKit's second micro-USB is the console. The pixel chain is driven by IO21." (at 24 440 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "7c84c15b-c0dc-47b4-b2bf-67844a1edebe"))
