  (text "J8: the rail's cable (channel 7): motor, encoder LED supply (5 V through 47 R), encoder A/B, limit switch, grounds." (at 24 472 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "5db2904d-3746-4d4a-a654-444f3a8e3e61"))
  (text "D9 pin 1 -> J8 1, 9 -> 2, 3 -> 3, 8 -> 4, 6 -> 5, 4 -> 6, 5 and the shield -> 7/8 (the manuals' single-axis wiring table)." (at 24 476 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "5ad8bbc8-55b2-4f4d-abc7-22e23e18d2e6"))
  (text "ENCODER +5V PRESENT SENSE (rev 0.4 review, variant S: no hysteresis). Two channels on +5V: IO48 high AND IO38 low = present; IO48 low AND IO38 high = absent; any other pair = disagree = not present." (at 132.08 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "fdd6bd29-0ad5-5c1a-b36f-85e823643593"))
  (text "H (U1 pin 38, IO48): R61 56k / R62 100k divider, R63 22k series, D23 BAT85 clamp to 3V3. L (U1 pin 32, IO38): R64 3.0k / R65 1.3k tap on U20 IN-, U21 1.24 V reference on IN+ (R66 2.2k from 3V3)," (at 132.08 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "bcefda1f-68af-587e-8496-8234917e5d7b"))
  (text "U20 output open collector: R67 2.2k pull-up to 3V3, R68 4.7k series, D24 BAT85 clamp. Trip 3.86 / 4.10 / 4.35 V (min / typ / max). U20 runs from +5V itself, so a dead rail cannot pull the output low; R69 1k bleeds the net." (at 132.08 312.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "8c8ddade-b324-430f-a4f0-1e1e035f0a7e"))
  (text "Take +5V for R61, R64, R69 and U20 from the +5V net at the far end of the encoder feed copper, never from 5V_U1. R63 + D23 and R68 + D24 want to sit within 5 mm of U1 pins 38 and 32 (review 11.3), with no +5V copper within 2 mm of either stub; R61-R69 are upright." (at 132.08 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "5680c9c5-a05f-5aa1-8675-3f18de15be8e"))
  (text "U20 (LM393, one maker) and U21 (TLV431A) are soldered, not socketed. U21 pin map (TI LP package, SLVS139Z Table 4-1): 1 K, 2 A, 3 REF; A, the middle lead, lands on the GND pad; another maker's part only after its sheet shows the same. Meter K to GND before power. Rev 0.5: IO48 / IO38, any DevKitC-1 but a ...V part." (at 132.08 317.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d9c6bca7-3f63-55bf-ba71-59bcaea5242d"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Scorbot:R_VV") (at 152.4 330.2 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "7ce9586e-6c35-4cf6-978d-b80d159808c7")
